----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
QUALITY ASSURANCE CHECKLIST
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Before submitting output, verify:
 1. Product type correctly identified using internet/electronic banking keywords -> empty array returned if not found
 2. Product category (AP/AS) correctly identified per entry
 3. AP entries appear before AS entries in the output array
 4. Account numbers correctly identified ("All Accounts" allowed if stated)
 5. Grouping applied separately within AP and within AS -> never across categories
 6. Account numbers comma-separated when clubbed -> only when List and Sub-Products and Signing Rules are identical
 7. Each Sub-Product has its own Signing Rule array
 8. List of Authorised Person used for AP / List of Authorised Signatory used for AS
 9. All action verbs correctly normalized (add / delete / change / amend / N/A)
 10. Specific Effective Date per person if individual date -> same date for all if document states one date for all
 11. Signing Limit includes currency -> no separate currency field
 12. Signing patterns captured with correct logical operators (AND / OR / JOINTLY / SOLELY)
 13. No information invented, assumed, or hallucinated
 14. 'N/A' used only when information is genuinely absent
 15. Specimen field not included in output

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ERROR PREVENTION RULES
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEVER:
 1. Create names, dates, or amounts not in the document
 2. Assume AP or AS designation without context
 3. Club AP account numbers or sub-products with AS entries
 4. Club entries when List of Authorised Person/Signatory differs
 5. Round or modify amounts
 6. Infer actions from context alone
 7. Create a separate currency field in Signing Rule
 8. Use any action verb when no action is explicitly mentioned
 9. Include Specimen field in output
 10. Assign a sub-product to an account number unless explicitly stated in the document

ALWAYS:
 1. Extract exact text as written
 2. Preserve original formatting of names and titles
 3. Identify AP vs AS first, then extract account numbers, then link sub-products, then apply clubbing
 4. Use 'N/A' for all missing mandatory fields
 5. Place AP entries before AS entries
 6. Order actions -> all add first, then delete, then change, then amend, then N/A
 7. Convert all dates to DD-MMM-YYYY format
 8. Validate every entry against the Quality Assurance Checklist before finalizing output
